 r←Test_Input_Callbacks_008(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT;globalParms;parms
⍝ Exercise "Input" with on "onInitial" callback that corrects the Posn of some controls.
⍝ See also Test_Input_Callbacks_004 and Test_Input_Callbacks_007.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes
 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 #.TEMP.flag←0
 #.TEMP.OnInitial←{
     n←⍵
     ⎕IO←0 ⋄ ⎕ML←3
     n.RegEx.Posn[0]←n.∆Vgap+↑+⌿⊃n.Search_for.(Posn Size)
     n.Case_sensitive.Posn[0]←n.∆Vgap+↑+⌿⊃n.RegEx.(Posn Size)
     ⍬
 }
 #.TEMP.OnOkay←{
     #.TEMP.flag←1
     1
 }

 defMat←0 5⍴''
 defMat⍪←'&Search_for' '' ''DT.Character 0
 defMat⍪←'&RegEx' '' 0 DT.YesNo 0
 defMat⍪←'&Case_sensitive' '' 1 DT.YesNo 0

 globalParms←∆GetGlobalParms
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←50 50
 parms.onInitial←#.TEMP'OnInitial'
 parms.onOkay←'#.TEMP.OnOkay'
 parms.addToCaption←'No. ',⍕∆GetTestCaseNo

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat globalParms parms
 ⎕NQ n.Btn_00'Select'
 0 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →T.GoToTidyUp #.TEMP.flag=0

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
